      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_02e1e8a2",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: islam_is_the_religion_of_peace_piece_of_you_over_here_piece_of_you_over_there; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image juxtaposes a man dressed in Islamic attire with the text 'islam is the religion of peace' at the top and 'piece of you over here, piece of you over there' at the bottom. The latter phrase is a derogatory, violent, and dehumanizing metaphor often used to describe Muslims or people of Islamic faith, implying they are fragmented, dangerous, or should be separated or eliminated. This combination is intended to mock and demean Muslims, associating them with violence or chaos, and is a clear example of Islamophobic hate speech. The meme uses the visual of a calm, peaceful-looking man to contrast with the violent, hateful text, creating a jarring and offensive message that targets a specific religious group.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2b5f4964"
      },
