      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "islamophobia",
      "label": "System of prejudice and discrimination against Muslims",
      "description": "Islamophobia is the fear, hatred, or prejudice against Muslims, often manifesting as stereotypes, discrimination, or violence. It is fueled by misinformation, political agendas, and media portrayals that associate Islam with terrorism or barbarism. The meme in question is a clear example of Islamophobic hate speech, using visual and textual elements to demean and dehumanize Muslims by juxtaposing a peaceful image with violent language.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2b5f4964"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
