      "description": "This is a harmful stereotype that portrays Muslims as inherently violent or barbaric, often used to justify discrimination or violence against them. The meme uses this stereotype implicitly by juxtaposing the peaceful image of the man with the violent phrase 'piece of you over here, piece of you over there', suggesting that even a peaceful-looking Muslim is somehow connected to violence or chaos, which is a core tenet of Islamophobic rhetoric.",
